<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Canandaigua cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Canandaigua cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut its rating on Canandaigua Wine Co Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Martin Romm was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company said last night it had cut its earnings estimate for the fiscal year ending February 28, 1997 to $1.10-$1.40 per share from $2.30-$2.50 per share. Canandaigua earned $1.92 pre share in the previous year, exclusive of non-recurring and one-time items.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 4-7/8 at 17-1/8.</p>
</text>
